  "notes": "{分類|ぶんるい} refers to organizing items into categories based on shared characteristics.\n\nUSAGE:\nUsed with する to form {分類|ぶんるい}する (to classify).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{分類|ぶんるい}する: to classify ~\n- 〜に{分類|ぶんるい}される: to be classified as ~\n- {種類|しゅるい}ごとに{分類|ぶんるい}する: to classify by type\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {分類|ぶんるい}{表|ひょう}: classification table\n- {分類|ぶんるい}{学|がく}: taxonomy\n- {分類|ぶんるい}{番号|ばんごう}: classification number\n\nEVERYDAY USES:\n- ゴミの{分類|ぶんるい}: garbage sorting\n- {書類|しょるい}の{分類|ぶんるい}: document classification\n\nUsed in academic, scientific, and everyday contexts.",
